    "created_at": "2016-04-06T19:53:32Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-06T19:53:32Z",
    "body": "I switched things up a bit (sorry no fixup commit) to make it clearer that preventDefault() is the correct thing to do. I added some authoring guidance and wording about how the entire interface is legacy, instead of marking the whole thing w-nodev, since it seems weird to exclude an entire interface from the dev version.\n\nOne thing we could do is move the interface into https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#obsolete, but I wasn't sure, since it seems somewhat important to keep it near the rest of the unloading algorithms.\n",
